        DESCRIPTION "Belgae Tribe (will become part of Salisbury)\n\nFather: Sir Geraint ap Llwyd [GEH-rynt ahp THLOOEED]\n\n440: Constantine III murdered; Irish extend holdings. Fought at the Battle of the River Parrot against the Irish. Lost his right eye but gained an impressive, distinctive scar. +60 Glory. Developed a mild Suspicion of Atrebates warriors (Passion 7).\n\n442: Both Gorthyn's father and Paun's father attended the coronation of Constans.\n\n443: Constans is murdered.\n\n446: Pict invasion. Fought at the Battle of Lincoln. Distinguished himself despite his dead right eye. +540 Glory..\n\n447: Vortigern becomes High King. Saxons are given property; the Cymri were not consulted, many driven from their lands. A prelate from the Pope arrives to condemn laxities. Sir Geraint was present when the prelate healed someone of leprosy. +20 Glory.\n\n448: More Saxons arrive, as does Rowena. When Cymrics complained about favoritism towards the Saxons, Sir Geraint kept his head down.\n\n449: New foe on the continent: the Huns. Saxons prove useful defense against the Irish, pirates, and Picts. Sir Geraint kept his own counsel despite things getting worse.\n\n450: Vortigern marries Rowena, gives her father Hengest the entire county of Kent. While hunting in the woodlands, Sir Geraint offended the fae, who cursed our family's hunting (-5 to Hunting rolls).\n\n454: Fought the Irish in Cornwall. +920 Glory.\n\n456: Switched allegiance to the dissidents. Fell ill.\n\n457: Fought at the Battle of Kent on the side of the rebels. Died in battle. +60 Glory (Final Total: 2,282). Developed Hate (Vortigern) 13.\n\n**Family Legacy (After Sir Geraint's Death)**\n\nThe family remains rebels.\n\n458: Paun's uncle takes stewardship of the lands. Parts of the extended family pack up and move to Brittany.\n\n461: Cousin fought at the Battle of Watsom Channel.\n\n462: Relatives fought at the Battle of Ebbsfleet. Survived.\n\n463: Uncle killed by Kent Saxons at the Night of the Long Knives.\n\n**Paun's Inheritance:**\n\nHate (Saxons) Passion: rolled 15\n\nFae Curse: Hunting -5\n\nStarting Glory: 570"
